4. Upstream material

The Qwen parent is Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B, revision
1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0. Its original material is governed
by Apache License 2.0. A copy is included in
licenses/QWEN_APACHE_2.0.txt. Source:
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B

Training included examples from tatsu-lab/alpaca, whose data license is
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International. A copy is
included in licenses/ALPACA_DATA_LICENSE.txt. Sources:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/tatsu-lab/alpaca
https://github.com/tatsu-lab/stanford_alpaca

Stanford's Alpaca usage notice states that models trained using its dataset
should not be used outside research. This release is offered for
noncommercial research with that provenance disclosed. alphaBell grants no
additional rights in Qwen, Alpaca or any other third-party material, and
makes no representation that this license resolves every third-party right
that may apply to a particular use.

